              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 41:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndipo wakamwendea Gedalia huko Mizpa; nao ni hawa, Ishmaeli, mwana wa Nethania, na Yohana na Yonathani, wana wa Karea, na Seraya, mwana wa Tanhumethi, na wana wa Efai, Mnetofa, na Yezania, mwana wa Mmaaka, wao na watu wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Gedalia, mwana wa Ahikamu, mwana wa Shafani, akawaapia wao na watu wao, akisema, Msiogope kuwatumikia Wakaldayo; kaeni katika nchi, mkamtumikie mfalme wa Babeli; nayo itawafaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 16:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mimi, tazama, nitakaa Mizpa, ili nisimame mbele ya Wakaldayo watakaotujilia; lakini ninyi chumeni divai, na matunda ya wakati wa jua, na mafuta, mkaviweke vitu hivyo katika vyombo vyenu, mkakae katika miji yenu mliyoitwaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
